# Frecency sidecars written next to a memory store. Per-machine signals (see
# usage.py): each checkout keeps its own hot set, so they must never be
# committed. Matched at any depth — a store may live in .context/memory/,
# .claude/memory/ or wherever CONTEXT_MEMORY_DIR points.
_usage.json
_usage.json.lock
_usage.json.tmp

# Throwaway working files (audit scripts, one-off scratch data) — never meant
# to ship in the published package (W8-review finding, mct-Reifeplan Etappe 3:
# an untracked scratch/ file was one `git add -A` away from being published).
scratch/
